{"id":213602866,"slug":"owen-muir-joins-the-dtra-download","title":"Owen Muir Joins the DTRA Download Podcast ","subtitle":"And talks about his amazing trip to China.","post_date":"2026-09-01T17:56:24.268Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/owen-muir-joins-the-dtra-download","wordcount":176,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:43:20.055Z","body_sha256":"92aa8a7a93800b13cdec6b8312de5332598b5e83eca51366d4540a38e3d81e53","text_words":196,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>Regular readers will recall that your editor, Owen Muir, M.D., recently went to Beijing.  I’ve <a href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/a-dispatch-from-beijing?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">written about China here</a>, and subsequently my visit to <a href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/a-dispatch-from-beijing?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">Beijing Anding Hospital here</a>.  I went to take part in the Life Sciences Technology Forum with dear friends including <a href=\"https://cnssummit.org\">CNS Summit</a> creator <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/amirkalali/\">Amir Kalali, M.D.</a>, <a href=\"https://dawnbrockett.com\">Dawn Brockett</a>, <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/lipset/\">Craig Lipset</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/gary-zammit-11b775/\">Gary Zammit</a>, among others.  </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xh1G!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fce556755-1f4d-4d82-9f52-d43df1b37481_1268x620.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xh1G!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2F