\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>I got to spend time on the <a href=\"https://www.dtra.org\">DTRA</a> podcast talking about what China is about.  I hope you enjoy it.</p><iframe class=\"spotify-wrap podcast\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;image&quot;:&quot;https://i.scdn.co/image/ab6765630000ba8a7c6ad858dbea2c29aeb3a5f0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Reflections from the Life Science Technology Forum in China: Scale, Speed, and Ambition&quot;,&quot;subtitle&quot;:&quot;Digital Trials &amp; Research Alliance (DTRA)&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Episode&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.spotify.com/episode/0kCIiDmFjPs3mKKbh9QQ3b&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;noScroll&quot;:false}\" src=\"https://open.spotify.com/embed/episode/0kCIiDmFjPs3mKKbh9QQ3b\" frameborder=\"0\" gesture=\"media\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" allow=\"encrypted-media\" data-component-name=\"Spotify2ToDOM\"></iframe><p>It’s worth a brief mention: RAMHT New Orleans is coming up on September 14th.</p><p><span>Grab your </span><em><a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/ramht-psych-congress-2026-tickets-1990879180221\"><span>FREE ticket</span></a></em><span> via Eventbrite! </span></p><p>New Orleans<br>Historic BK House &amp; Gardens<br>1113 Chartres Street<br>Time: 5-9pm</p><p><span>We’ll be sharing more details on speakers, rapid-fire talks and panel discussions on the RAMHT </span><a href=\"https://www.rapidmentalhealth.com/\"><span>website</span></a><span> and </span><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/rapidmentalhealth/?viewAsMember=true\"><span>LinkedIn</span></a><span> page (follow us if you’re not!).</span></p><p><em>Sponsors include:</em></p><p><a href=\"https://definiumtx.com/\">Definium Therapeutics</a><span>, </span><a href=\"https://www.brainsway.com/\">BrainsWay</a><span>, </span><a href=\"https://www.salmahealth.com/\">Salma Health</a><span>, </span><a href=\"https://prolivrx.com/\">Neurolief</a><span>, </span><a href=\"https://www.mdhub.ai/\">MDHub</a><span>, </span><a href=\"https://www.axsome.com/\">Axsome</a><span>, </span><a href=\"https://www.universal-brain.com/\">Universal Brain</a><span> &amp; </span><a href=\"https://www.meetradial.com/\">Radial</a></p><p><span>Stay tuned, get excited for more &amp; see you in New Orleans! Also, we will have special guests. And surprises. And maybe….just maybe…</span><em><span>embarrassing merch, for me, personally.</span></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.eventbrite.com/e/ramht-psych-congress-2026-tickets-1990879180221&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Get your FREE RAMHT Tickets&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:&quot;button-wrapper&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary button-wrapper\" href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/ramht-psych-congress-2026-tickets-1990879180221\"><span>Get your FREE RAMHT Tickets</span></a></p><div><hr></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/owen-muir-joins-the-dtra-download?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/owen-muir-joins-the-dtra-download?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p><p></p><p> </p>","text":"Regular readers will recall that your editor, Owen Muir, M.D., recently went to Beijing. I’ve written about China here , and subsequently my visit to Beijing Anding Hospital here . I went to take part in the Life Sciences Technology Forum with dear friends including CNS Summit creator Amir Kalali, M.D. , Dawn Brockett , Craig Lipset , and Gary Zammit , among others.\n\nI got to spend time on the DTRA podcast talking about what China is about. I hope you enjoy it.\n\nIt’s worth a brief mention: RAMHT New Orleans is coming up on September 14th.\n\nGrab your FREE ticket via Eventbrite!\n\nNew Orleans\nHistoric BK House & Gardens\n1113 Chartres Street\nTime: 5-9pm\n\nWe’ll be sharing more details on speakers, rapid-fire talks and panel discussions on the RAMHT website and LinkedIn page (follow us if you’re not!).\n\nSponsors include:\n\nDefinium Therapeutics , BrainsWay , Salma Health , Neurolief , MDHub , Axsome , Universal Brain & Radial\n\nStay tuned, get excited for more & see you in New Orleans! Also, we will have special guests. And surprises. And maybe….just maybe… embarrassing merch, for me, personally.\n\nGet your FREE RAMHT Tickets\n\nSubscribe now\n\nShare"}